WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:21.080
Coach Kudou!

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.080
Um...

00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:28.440
Did you have to resign because of what happened in the game?

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:30.110
That's not it.

00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:33.240
I knew fully well this would happen.

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:34.690
But...

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:39.180
I wanted to learn soccer from you.

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:42.310
I want to play soccer!

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:45.470
I want to get better and stronger at it.

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:48.360
But... what do I do now?

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:53.360
You can figure that out only by continuing soccer.

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:01.980
All that's left is to work at it with the new coach.

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:18.580
A new coach...

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:16.000
Pick up the pace, Amagi!

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:18.380
Kurama!

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:23.760
Hey, you could've made that one in.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:26.120
Sorry.

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:30.390
Shin-sama's not here...

00:03:32.490 --> 00:03:34.980
Where do you think Captain is?

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:36.160
Well...

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:41.280
That shoot he made in the match against Eito must've...

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.390
What's wrong?

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:44.030
Nothing!

00:03:48.070 --> 00:03:49.910
What a pathetic captain.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:51.710
What's wrong with you all?!

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:53.860
Concentrate!

00:03:53.860 --> 00:03:55.750
Say what you like, but...

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.500
We just can't get into it.

00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:58.840
What?

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:02.530
Well, the coach has resigned.

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:04.260
And the captain's not showing up.

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:14.610
It's because he did all that unnecessary junk.

00:04:18.170 --> 00:04:20.480
What's going to happen with the soccer club now?

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:27.990
Coach Kudou still gave us freedom even when the reins on us were this tight.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:30.240
But even that won't be the same anymore.

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:36.000
It's gonna be some guy from Fifth Sector, right?

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:41.540
As long as we do whatever he orders, 
it'll look good on our student records.

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:42.760
And you're fine with that?!

00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:46.090
That's the point of doing soccer in school in the first place, isn't it?

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:50.670
So it's gonna be the same no matter who comes, is that it?

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:53.020
That's not true!

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:24.780
It's been a long time!

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:26.830
Who's that?

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:27.220
Dunno...

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:30.570
Is this everyone?

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:34.050
No, the captain is absent.

00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:34.770
Okay.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:38.850
I'm Raimon soccer club's coach starting from today,

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:39.770
Endou Mamoru.

00:05:41.030 --> 00:05:44.370
Endou Mamoru, the legendary goalkeeper?!

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:47.690
I look forward to working with you all!

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:50.040
Seriously?

00:05:50.510 --> 00:05:51.590
This is a surprise.

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:54.920
Endou-san, you're the new coach?

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:55.800
Yeah.

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:58.150
Awesome, it's really him!

00:05:58.150 --> 00:05:59.140
Yeah!

00:05:59.140 --> 00:06:01.670
Endou-san teaching us soccer...

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:03.160
It's like a dream come true!

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:08.610
Here's the schedule after school.

00:06:08.610 --> 00:06:11.560
We'll be practicing at the riverbank grounds.

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:13.280
The riverbank?

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:14.640
Why over there?

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:18.730
You might be able to see something that you wouldn't be able to see from the school grounds.

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:21.830
Something we can't see from the school grounds?

00:06:21.830 --> 00:06:24.150
And why do we need to see something like that?

00:06:24.930 --> 00:06:25.820
In order to win.

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:27.790
In order to win?

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:32.910
If we all train together, Raimon will surely get stronger.

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:33.870
I'll be waiting!

00:06:37.170 --> 00:06:38.850
Training, huh?

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:41.000
I wonder what we'll be doing!

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.030
What the heck is with him?

00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:45.480
He said it's in order for us to win...

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:49.500
That's not something you'd expect from a coach from Fifth Sector.

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:51.050
Smells like trouble.

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:52.720
This really smells like trouble.

00:06:56.110 --> 00:06:59.250
Um... aren't any of you going?

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:02.550
I'm out!

00:07:02.550 --> 00:07:03.180
Hey!

00:07:03.180 --> 00:07:06.840
Minamisawa-san, didn't you say you were just going to do whatever they ordered?

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:08.690
It's case by case.

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:10.570
Sure is.

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:11.910
Okay, me too then.{oiii}

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:15.560
What the heck can you do at the riverbank?

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:17.740
Didn't Endou-san just say?

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:21.080
You might be able to see something that you wouldn't be able to see from the school grounds.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.990
Then if you see something, tell us about it.

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:24.750
But...

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:33.100
Let's go.

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:33.920
Y-Yeah...

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:36.940
What should we do, Tenma?

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:43.170
Let's go, Shinsuke.

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:45.780
I want to learn soccer from Endou-san.

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:47.660
I want to get better!

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:49.730
Yeah, me too!

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:51.970
Okay, let's do it!

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:52.940
Yeah!

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:56.700
What's the meaning of this?!

00:07:56.970 --> 00:08:00.000
It's different from the data we were given.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:03.010
Yes, I'm trying to get the situation cleared up right now.

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:07.130
Hello?

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:08.890
Yes...

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:12.320
Yes...

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:19.160
It seems Endou Mamoru's position as coach has been officially registered with them.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:20.660
What?!

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:26.480
I can't possibly imagine Fifth Sector would dispatch someone like him as the coach.

00:08:27.140 --> 00:08:28.510
What should we do?

00:08:28.510 --> 00:08:30.150
We <i>can't</i>  do anything about it.

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:32.950
Fifth Sector approved it.

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:38.620
Just what is the Holy Emperor thinking?

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:46.380
We're gonna be first!

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:47.820
Tenma!

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:49.480
Don't forget your spikes!

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:51.660
Oops, I almost forgot.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:01.470
They're here.

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:11.590
Matsukaze Tenma.

00:09:11.590 --> 00:09:12.540
Yes, sir!

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:13.810
Nishizono Shinsuke.

00:09:13.810 --> 00:09:14.820
Yes, sir!

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:15.720
I was waiting.

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:16.720
Yes, sir!

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:19.530
You don't have to be so tense.

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:21.500
If you don't loosen up, you might get injured.

00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:21.990
Okay!

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:25.420
Only those two came in the end.

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:26.580
I guess so.

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:29.500
Um, what are we doing for training?

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:30.930
That.

00:09:31.940 --> 00:09:35.130
Tenma, lay those out and line them up evenly.

00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:38.690
Dribbling is your specialty, right?

00:09:38.690 --> 00:09:39.560
Yes, sir!

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:42.760
We'll polish up your specialty first.

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:45.540
Go back and forth on the grounds until I say you're ready.

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:46.350
Okay!

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:50.050
Shinsuke, we'll train your heading accuracy.

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:50.520
Okay!

00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:57.140
I'll learn to dribble better than all the rest!

00:09:59.840 --> 00:10:02.740
Bring it back to the front with precision.

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:05.160
Here it comes! Here!

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:06.790
To the front!

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:10.120
Good work. That's the way, Shinsuke!

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:10.900
Yeah!

00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:13.810
It's kind of sad with just the two of them.

00:10:13.810 --> 00:10:17.390
Even if it's just two for today, a day will definitely come when they all join in.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:22.190
I'm sure they all want to play real soccer.

00:10:22.190 --> 00:10:24.840
As long as that's how they feel, they'll come.

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:39.670
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:44.800
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:14.100
What have I done...

00:11:17.240 --> 00:11:17.900
Yes?

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:20.690
Mr. Kirino is here to see you.

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:22.690
Kirino?

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:25.070
Let him in.

00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:26.330
As you wish.

00:11:30.970 --> 00:11:32.290
Are you okay?

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:33.390
Yeah.

00:11:33.390 --> 00:11:34.240
I see.

00:11:36.930 --> 00:11:39.520
Our new coach came today.

00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:40.880
Who do you think it is?

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:43.020
Who is it?

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:44.380
Endou Mamoru.

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:47.990
It really does come as a shocker.

00:11:47.990 --> 00:11:50.320
Is it really that Endou-san?

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:53.060
Yeah. But he's a little strange.

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:57.280
Right off the top, he asked us to train with winning in mind.

00:11:57.280 --> 00:11:59.220
And at the riverbank.

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:02.940
I don't think anyone's going.

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:04.990
Just the newcomers.

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:07.660
Train with winning in mind...

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:16.480
What're you doing?

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:20.550
This is where Endou-san and Raimon's soccer club started.

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:26.010
I've been thinking about what we can't see from the school grounds.

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:32.270
What are they doing for training?

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:33.640
Who cares.

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:38.850
We'd already be training long ago if we could win soccer fair and square all the time.

00:12:38.850 --> 00:12:40.360
That's for sure!

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:43.350
And we're all suffering because we can't.

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:57.710
Okay, next drill!

00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:00.460
Tenma, dribble while going after me!

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:02.670
When I make the call, pass it to Shinsuke!

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:03.210
Okay!

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:06.430
That's Endou Mamoru...

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:12.790
It's normal practice.

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:15.220
They didn't have to go out here for <i>that.</i>

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:17.680
What're you guys doing here?

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:19.020
What about yourselves?

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:21.840
So we're all curious about it.

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:32.290
What's wrong, worn out?

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:33.890
Not yet!

00:13:33.890 --> 00:13:35.170
Me neither!

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:36.580
All right, let's keep going!

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:39.000
Why are they even trying so hard?

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:46.840
Nice work! Don't give up to the very end!

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:47.630
Yes, sir!

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:48.470
Good-for-nothings.

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:52.180
We were like that at the start too.

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:53.100
Yeah.

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:55.730
But it sure was fun.

00:13:56.390 --> 00:14:00.610
Did this coach really come from Fifth Sector?

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:02.570
Tenma!

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:05.580
Ow...

00:14:11.270 --> 00:14:12.300
Tsurugi.

00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:14.350
Oh, you came, Tsurugi!

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:15.620
Could you get that ball for us?

00:14:16.090 --> 00:14:16.770
What?

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:17.870
Let's play soccer!

00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:21.030
It makes my blood boil...

00:14:21.030 --> 00:14:23.100
Your "let's play soccer", that is!

00:14:23.100 --> 00:14:24.290
Oh.

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:25.430
Hey!

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:28.580
Don't stay back there, guys. Come on out!

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:38.810
They all came.

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:42.410
Did Endou-san pull them all in?

00:14:44.970 --> 00:14:47.680
For starters, show me your kick strength.

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:49.710
One shoot each.

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:54.390
Then can I kick first?

00:14:54.390 --> 00:14:56.490
Don't butt in, newcomer.

00:14:57.610 --> 00:14:59.040
Okay, we'll start with Kurama.

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:08.060
Nice shoot!

00:15:08.060 --> 00:15:10.160
Just what I'd expect from Raimon's forward.

00:15:11.380 --> 00:15:12.650
Next is Hamano!

00:15:13.980 --> 00:15:14.590
Okay!

00:15:24.030 --> 00:15:25.480
Looking nice, everyone!

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:27.070
You've all got skill!

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:29.400
Next, Tenma!

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:30.080
Okay!

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:33.660
All right...

00:15:38.930 --> 00:15:40.120
Don't worry about it.

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:42.080
That kick power was pretty intense.

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:43.700
Yes, sir!

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:44.850
Last is Tsurugi!

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:50.630
You're the only one left.

00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:53.930
Let's play soccer!

00:15:56.570 --> 00:15:59.080
Fine... I'll do it.

00:16:46.140 --> 00:16:47.650
Death Sword!

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:56.700
What?

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:09.880
That was an awesome shoot! You're good!

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:12.980
What a joke.

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:21.510
That was a shock.

00:17:21.510 --> 00:17:23.410
I thought he'd get hit.

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:24.260
Yeah...

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:28.220
I thought he'd stop it with a hissatsu technique...

00:17:28.220 --> 00:17:30.130
That's all for today's practice!

00:17:31.240 --> 00:17:32.810
Just one shoot?

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:36.510
So what is it we weren't able to see from the school grounds?

00:17:36.510 --> 00:17:39.650
You all came here to train for winning, right?

00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:41.140
Then you've seen it.

00:17:42.030 --> 00:17:46.240
The faces of your friends with their goal set for victory.

00:17:46.240 --> 00:17:48.880
The faces of the guys who want to play real soccer.

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:54.560
We're all here.

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:56.550
That was our training for today!

00:17:57.000 --> 00:18:00.090
I'll be waiting for you at the school grounds tomorrow!

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:09.780
Shindou...

00:18:14.680 --> 00:18:15.710
Huh?

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:17.210
Tenma, where's your stuff?

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:18.870
I forgot!

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:20.280
Go ahead without me!

00:18:21.310 --> 00:18:24.700
He's always got his head in the clouds when it's not about soccer.

00:18:27.230 --> 00:18:28.370
You forgot something.

00:18:29.410 --> 00:18:30.850
Thank you!

00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:34.450
Why did you come to practice?

00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:37.420
Because I want to play soccer!

00:18:38.490 --> 00:18:42.250
I'm not good at all yet, but I love soccer!

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:44.650
I see.

00:18:44.650 --> 00:18:46.560
I'll be waiting for you tomorrow, Tenma.

00:18:46.990 --> 00:18:48.980
Okay, Coach Endou!

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:55.800
I'm back, Sasuke.

00:18:57.660 --> 00:18:59.100
Welcome back.

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:00.920
It's pretty late. Practice?

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:03.090
Yeah! We were training!

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:03.770
Training?

00:19:03.770 --> 00:19:05.770
Yeah, he taught me dribbling.

00:19:06.550 --> 00:19:09.930
And we have a new coach!

00:19:09.930 --> 00:19:13.120
He's the legendary soccer player, Endou Mamoru!

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:14.170
Endou-kun?!

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:16.830
Aki-nee, do you know him?

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:19.010
Yeah, we were classmates.

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:22.120
Didn't I mention that?

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:24.670
First time I've heard it! Why didn't you tell me?

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:26.930
Sorry, I forgot to tell you.

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:30.810
Dinner is ready.

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:34.200
Say, what kind of person is Endou-san?

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:36.120
Let's see...

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:41.880
A bit like you, Tenma.

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:52.530
Sorry for pushing the trouble onto you.

00:19:52.530 --> 00:19:53.620
It's okay.

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:56.870
Although, I was surprised when I got the call from you.

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:02.840
The condition of soccer has decayed.

00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:05.340
The soccer we once knew no longer exists.

00:20:06.090 --> 00:20:09.040
There's no meaning in victory.

00:20:09.040 --> 00:20:13.790
After victory, all that awaits are empty feelings from betraying soccer.

00:20:13.790 --> 00:20:15.270
Coach Kudou...

00:20:15.720 --> 00:20:19.650
Soccer has become a tool to gain fame.

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:23.570
So this is how people took the world championship title we fought for?

00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:30.950
Coach, I want to bring Raimon back to how it used to be.

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:38.120
But we're up against an enemy far greater than we've ever faced before.

00:20:38.120 --> 00:20:39.690
Fifth Sector?

00:20:40.390 --> 00:20:41.530
Yeah.

00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:46.140
They not only have control over youth soccer, but they're on their way to taking over the entire soccer world.

00:20:47.690 --> 00:20:51.230
Raimon's soccer club is at its peak of despair right now,

00:20:51.230 --> 00:20:54.050
but it still has a shred of hope.

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:57.610
Yeah, he's an interesting kid.

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:05.070
They're in your hands now, Endou. 
 Raimon's future... and soccer's.

00:21:05.470 --> 00:21:07.660
Hang tough, Coach Endou.

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:09.280
Yes, sir!

00:21:14.480 --> 00:21:16.550
I won't give up either.

